message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: scigantic-pubchem
abstract: "Query PubChem live via PUG REST with rate-limit-aware retry and an expiring cache. Covers similarity, substructure and cross-reference search, bioassay, gene and protein data, the Tox21 Data Challenge panel, and CID-keyed reads of a local parquet mirror."
authors:
  - name: Scigantic
    website: https://scigantic.com
repository-code: https://github.com/Scigantic/scigantic-pubchem
url: https://pypi.org/project/scigantic-pubchem/
license: MIT-0
keywords:
